From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebberich <sebberich@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 17:13:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/29] Mobile: Add the shopping list screens

"Shopping lists" entry in the side menu: overview, list screen with
suggestion chips, emoji tiles grouped by category and a "recently
bought" section, sharing via QR code, link or code, joining via QR scan
or pasted invite, members and roles, sync status line and the nearby
status circle (grey until the Bluetooth transport exists). Settings
section for relays, device name and nearby auto-off. Invite links open
the app through an intent filter. German translations included.

